WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.049 --> 00:00:12.611
Wintertime, wintertime.

2
00:00:12.612 --> 00:00:16.331
Cold winds, cold winds.

3
00:00:16.332 --> 00:00:22.874
Winter is cold.

4
00:00:22.875 --> 00:00:30.383
Springtime, springtime.

5
00:00:30.384 --> 00:00:39.441
Chirping birds, chirping birds.

6
00:00:39.442 --> 00:00:45.812
Spring is warm.

7
00:00:45.813 --> 00:00:55.244
Summertime, summertime.

8
00:00:55.245 --> 00:01:03.210
Hot sun, hot sun.

9
00:01:03.211 --> 00:01:11.218
Summer is hot.

10
00:01:11.219 --> 00:01:18.755
Now it's fall, now it's fall.

11
00:01:18.756 --> 00:01:24.832
Falling leaves, falling leaves.

12
00:01:24.833 --> 00:01:38.839
Fall is cool.

